<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<!-- Direct-distribution build: leaving App Sandbox disabled is intentional.
     Finder grants a sandboxed viewer only the selected .md file, while
     Markdown routinely references arbitrary sibling assets. The app performs
     read-only coordinated access and never writes referenced resources. -->
<dict/>
</plist>
